+# Booking cancellation
+
+`cancel(bookingId, at)` cancels a booking at the instant `at` (ISO-8601 UTC) and returns
+`{ bookingId, refund }`. A cancelled booking no longer holds its equipment, so the item is available again
+for that period. A booking can only be cancelled once; an unknown booking id is an error.
+
+## Open questions (to settle with /speckit-clarify)
+
+- Refund amount: no refund policy is stated. The refund is the full booking total, whatever `at` is, until the
+  school decides (for example a partial refund close to the start, or none once the rental has started).
+- `at` is only validated as an ISO-8601 UTC time; it is not compared with the booking period.
